 ving chaired the Building and Grounds (B&amp\;G) Committee for many years\
 , Ken wanted to recreate the fellowship that would happen on B&amp\;G Work
  Day events when parishioners volunteered time to clean up and repair item
 s around the Church's campus. Ken scheduled a Saturday morning once a mont
 h at the Pilgrim Diner in Cedar Grove with a group of 6-8 guys during whic
 h they would share conversation and life experience with one another. This
  breakfast group will now meet on the <b>second Saturday of each month fro
 m 8:30 to 10am</b> (unless otherwise indicated on the website calendar). 
 For more information\, speak with Father Jerry or Ken Traficante</span><sp
 an>.</span></span>
