 riencing the present moment. Simple instructions to help me and you to ope
 n to and experience whatever occurs in and around you in the moment You ca
 n find me or DM me on Facebook or Instagram where my username is Anette Ro
 næss or [@aronaess](https://www.instagram.com/aronaess/).\n\nPlease be aw
 are that sessions will close if no members have joined after 10 minutes.
