DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T170000
SUMMARY:NJ Code & Coffee - November meetup
DESCRIPTION:NJ Code & Coffee\n**NJ Code and Coffee: Saturday\, November 14
 th\, 2-5pm at EqualSpace ES550 Tech & Innovation Campus**\n\nCalling all N
 ew Jersey techies to the monthly NJ Code and Coffee meetup!\nCoffee\, good
  conversation\, zero pressure.\n\nCode and Coffee is an inclusive\, inform
 al networking session for people in tech and the tech-curious. Developers\
 , data engineers\, UX/UI designers\, data scientists\, product managers\, 
 solution architects\, founders\, operators\, and investors are all welcome
 \, at every skill and experience level\, even first-timers and career-chan
 gers.\n\nMost people come to chat\, and some bring a laptop to work on a p
 roject. Either is welcome. It’s entirely up to you!\n\nCome grab a coffe
 e\, meet new people\, find collaborators\, talk tech (or anything but tech
 )\, and take a break from the screen or the job hunt.\n\n**Agenda**\n**2:0
 0pm:** Doors open\, networking starts\n**2:30pm:** Intro circle\n**3:00pm:
 ** Networking continues\n**3:00-4:00pm:** Optional career workshop in a se
 parate space (details/RSVP here: [https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/ev
 ents/317224995/](https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/events/317224995/))
 \n**5:00pm:** Event ends\n**After 5pm:** Hang out at a local brewery/resta
 urant (location TBD\, we’ll announce it at the event)\n\nThe workshop is
  totally optional. Skip it and keep chatting if you’d prefer. If you do 
 join\, please plan to arrive on time and stay for the full hour.\n\n**The 
 Intro Circle**\nAround 2:30pm\, we’ll stand in a circle for a few organi
 zer announcements\, then go around the room. Keep it to 10 seconds or less
 \, and share whichever of these apply to you:\n\n* Your name and your role
 \, job title\, or tech stack\n* What you can help others with\n* What you
 ’d like help with\n* Whether you’re hiring\, or looking for work.\n\nN
 ervous about speaking up? A name and one sentence is plenty. After the cir
 cle\, everything is self-organized.\n\n**Details**\n\n* Cost: Free!\n* Cof
 fee and light refreshments provided\n\n**Community Discord: come hang out 
 before and after!**\n[https://www.codeandcoffee.chat](https://www.codeandc
 offee.chat)\n\n**The Venue**\nEqualSpace is a shared workspace in downtown
  Newark\, built with multicultural business owners in mind. It offers star
 tups resources\, programming\, and a strong network of founders and collab
 orators. Learn more: [https://equalspace.co/](https://equalspace.co/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/events/316133459/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260815T221317Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T221317Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
