SUMMARY:Your Code Speaks for itself. Can You? Interactive Workshop
DESCRIPTION:NJ Code & Coffee\n​NJ Code and Coffee and Growing The Middle
  present "Your Code Speaks for Itself. Can You? An Interactive Workshop fo
 r Tech Professionals".\n\n​You’re great at what you do\, but can you c
 learly explain the value you bring?\n\n​In this interactive 60-minute wo
 rkshop\, you’ll learn how to turn your everyday technical work into a co
 mpelling story about your skills and impact.\n\nThrough hands-on activitie
 s and peer conversations\, you’ll build and practice a stronger professi
 onal introduction that helps you stand out when networking\, interviewing\
 , and exploring new opportunities.\n\nDoors open at 2pm\, talk starts at 3
 pm\, arrive early for networking and light refreshments.\n\n​About the s
 peaker:\n\n​Mariah Bayne is a Talent Development Strategist\, speaker\, 
 and Founder of Growing the Middle and The Work Room\, a in person professi
 onal development community.\n\n​Mariah brings 13 years of experience acr
 oss Talent Development\, Sales\, Customer Success\, Operations\, and Accou
 nt Management. She has led teams\, managed a $500 million enterprise portf
 olio.\nShe has delivered more than 70 workshops\, and built programs that 
 improved employee retention\, accelerated performance\, while creating new
  paths into leadership.\n\n​Her belief\, most professionals do not have 
 a skill gap\; they have a recognition gap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/events/317224995/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261031T213257Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261031T213257Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
