SUMMARY:Navesink Brass 250 Years of American Music
DESCRIPTION:The Navesink Brass\, a five piece brass quintet\, returns to 
 the Nutley Public Library for a concert to celebrate America’s 250th 
 Anniversary with a setlist of patriotic songs on Saturday\, November 14 at 
 2 pm on the Second Floor of the Library. This is the rescheduled date for 
 the show that was originally planned for August.\n\nThis is part of our 
 program series\, celebrating America’s 250th Anniversary.
LOCATION:Nutley - Children's Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10315-17413417
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17413417
