SUMMARY:Knitting Club - INTEREST MEETING
DESCRIPTION:Are you tired of knitting alone? Do you want to start crochet 
 but can't figure out the right Granny square? Want to explore the colorful 
 world of fiber arts? Become a founding member of the Glen Ridge Public 
 Library's newest Knitting Club.\n\nJoin us for our first Interest Meeting 
 on Monday\, November 16th as we introduce ourselves to one another\, share 
 our projects\, and establish the format of the club.\n\nCan't make the 
 first meeting? No worries! Join us for the second Interest Meeting on 
 Monday\, December 7th at 6:30 PM.\n\nAdult Club | RSVP requested*\n*Glen 
 Ridge residents ONLY
