SUMMARY:[MILL Senior Friday] Arthritis & Joint Replacement Options
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nDr. Ridvan Husic\, foot & ankle 
 surgeon\, demystifies chronic pain management from custom bracing to ankle 
 replacement. Learn practical self-care habits\, explore modern treatment 
 pathways\, and get your medical questions answered directly by the 
 expert.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class is run by the MILL. Please register 
 for classes directly through their website here.\n\nFor questions about 
 MILL classes please call 973-744-3278.\n\nMILL @ MPL is made possible 
 through a partnership between the MILL\, Montclair Public Library and 
 Partners for Health.
