 Rec Center main office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for Stud
 ents  $20\n\n \nWhere and when?\n\nNovember 21 2026 \n10am-4pm\nBegins at
  Student Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to bring: Water\, lunch\, long pant
 s\, sneakers\, and sunscreen. Participants MUST wear sneakers in order to
  go on the zipline and obstacle course.\n \nNote: Tree Top Adventures res
 tricts obstacle course and zipline participants to a strict weight limit 
 of 250 lbs. Students may opt to participate in only the Zoo portion of th
 e trip should they like.\n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather cha
 nges\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisono
 us plants\, insect bites and injury by running\, including sprains\, lace
 rations\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/eng
 age/event/12498900
