SUMMARY:Paperbook Pals Book Club (Grades 2-4) BELLEVUE AVE. BRANCH
DESCRIPTION:Each month\, we gather to discuss a high-interest chapter book 
 or graphic novel. We will check for understanding\, share opinions and also 
 play reading comprehension games. If there is time\, we will make a small 
 craft.\n\nRegistration required.\n\nThis month’s book pick will be: I 
 survived the California wildfires\, 2018 : the graphic novel (by Georgia 
 Ball).\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
