SUMMARY:English for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) - Beginner to Intermediate
DESCRIPTION:English for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) - Beginner to 
 Intermediate is designed to assist adult students in mastering the English 
 language by emphasizing speaking\, listening\, reading\, and writing 
 skills. \n\nStudents should bring their own notebook and pencils for note 
 taking.\n\nRegistration is required. Please notify us at 
 adultprograms@montclairlibrary.org if you are going to miss class. If you 
 do not attend the classes without notifying us\, you will not be allowed to 
 register for our next English class.\n\nClass runs from Wednesday\, October 
 28-Wednesday\, December 9. Class will not meet on Wednesday\, Nov. 25 but 
 will meet Tuesday\, Nov. 24.
