SUMMARY:STEM Saturdays with Mrs.Thressa
DESCRIPTION:Join us on as we dive into a S.T.E.M. (Science Technology 
 Engineering &\nMath) storytime\, then engage in an interactive activity 
 that connects to the\nstory!\n\nWe will be engaging in kitchen science this 
 STEM Saturday and working with foods like\; cranberries\, dairy\, and 
 popcorn.\n\nIf dairy or gluten is something your family doesn't work with 
 please let us know so we can work with you and try to be accomodating so 
 your child can still participate.\n\nRegistration highly encouraged so we 
 can have a headcount and properly have enough for everyone to 
 partake.\n\nRecommended ages 5-11
