DESCRIPTION:  \n**Shomrei is Planning a Trip to Poland - Join us for a me
 eting where you will have a chance to learn more.**   \n  \n  \n**The Tri
 p**  \nA Journey Honoring Jewish Life in Poland\, Past and Present  \nOct
 ober 25 - November 2\, 2027  \nJoin Rabbi Julie and fellow congregants for
  the trip of a lifetime as we explore 1\,000 years of Jewish life in Polan
 d\, together as a community.  \n  \n**Purpose of this Meeting**  \nThis me
 eting will help everyone better understand the trip\, learn more and ask 
 questions. This meeting will be the ONLY in person chance to do so BEFORE 
 registration opens in January.   \n  \n**Who should attend**  \nThe meeti
 ng is open to everyone who is considering the trip\, even those who did no
 t submit the interest form.   \n  \n**RSVP required** (Contact the Shomre
 i Office for the organizer's email.)  \nYou will be emailed the itinerary 
 and other trip information after you register. Please review the these mat
 erials before the meeting.   \n  \nNote that if you’ve already sent in 
 an Interest Form and/or RSVP’d for the meeting\, there is no need to do 
 again.  \n  \n**Contact the Shomrei Office**   \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(9
 73) 746-5031\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T172050Z
LOCATION:Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2188736507
