SUMMARY:First Friday Movie- Blue Heron
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a movie matinee on the first Friday of the month. 
 Bag lunch provided by Toni's Kitchen.\n\n***\n\nBlue Heron (2026)\n1h 
 31m\nDirected by: Sophy Romvari \n\nWhen an immigrant family moves to 
 Vancouver Island in the 1990s\, the eldest son's behavior begins to throw 
 their lives off balance. This Canadian filmmaker's feature debut was a 
 festival favorite but difficult to catch in local theaters. Here's your 
 chance to catch a rare and free screening of a movie named by many critics 
 as one of the year's best.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 2
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
