DESCRIPTION:The semester flew by\, oh\, where did it go?The weeks turned t
 o months much faster than we know.\nBefore we all head Back to Desh\, joi
 n the Bangladesh Student Association for one final celebration! We'll pla
 y games\, share laughs\, enjoy delicious food\, and make memories that wi
 ll last long after we pack our bags.\nWe'll remember the friends we made\
 , the moments we shared\, and the little pieces of home we found right he
 re. So come laugh\, come eat\, and come celebrate with us one last time b
 efore the semester comes to an end.\nThe goodbyes may begin\, but don't y
 ou feel blue...Because before you know it\, we'll be back here with you!\
 nWe'll see you next semester!\nLove\,Your BSA Board Members💚🩷\n\nHosted
  by: Bangladesh Student Association \n\nAdditional Information can be fou
 nd at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12790677
DTEND:20261209T203000Z
