DESCRIPTION:The prayers we recite by rote each week were not handed down f
 ully formed from heaven—they were written by real people\, reaching for 
 words to express their hopes and fears\,their loves and losses.Over time\,
  those personal prayersbecame the shared liturgy of the Jewish people.But 
 sometimes\, the ancient words of others don’t quite resonate\,which is w
 hy the process of prayer writing must be ongoing.Join Rabbi Feder once a m
 onth at 10:00amto explore new liturgy being written for our current moment
 and
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/creative-liturgy-workshop-2/2026-12-12/
