DTSTART:20261213T190000Z
DTEND:20261213T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261213T000000Z
SUMMARY:Charcoal Drawing for Non-Artists
DESCRIPTION:with Jenny Santa Maria\, Flame Tip Studio\n\nNever taken an art 
 class before? Want to produce realistic work? This hands-on workshop is 
 designed especially for “non-artists”. Working from carefully curated 
 still lifes featuring bones\, pumpkins\, flowers\, and other seasonal 
 objects\, you'll learn how to create depth\, form\, and realistic shading 
 using vine charcoal. Discover the joy of drawing from life and the 
 confidence that comes with learning a new way to see.\n\nAll materials 
 provided.\n\nRegistration is required and will open two weeks before the 
 workshop date.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
UID:LibCal-10341-17302601
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17302601
END:VEVENT
