 om the Keating Crawford Foundation and presented in memory of Beatrice Cr
 awford\, a Montclair musician who directed the choral ensembles The Madri
 gals and The Choraliers.\nFree Tickets Reservations Required\nLearn more 
 about the University Symphony Orchestra at Montclair's Cali School of Mus
 ic\n\n\nHosted by: The College of the Arts\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12657956
