SUMMARY:Hooked on Books Reading Club (Grades 4-6)
DESCRIPTION:Mondays at 6:30 PM on September 28\, October 26\, November 16 
 and December 14 \n\nA book chat with games and awesome activities! \n\nFor 
 students entering grades 4-6 in Fall 2026. Registration is required. 
 \n\nWhat we're reading: \n\n\n	September 28: Monster Locker by Jorge 
 Augusto Aguirre\n	October 26: The House with a Clock in Its Walls by John 
 Bellairs\n	November 16: Dealing with Dragons by Patricia Wrede\n	December 
 14: Crumble by Meredith McLaren\n\n\nFor more information\, please visit 
 nutleypubliclibrary.org or call 973-667-0405 ext. 2623. \n
