SUMMARY:Friends of the Library presents Home for a Gnome with Caldwell Flowerland-Registration Required
DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Library and Caldwell Flowerland for a 
 magical winter adventure at the library! Children will create their very 
 own enchanted winter wonderland\, complete with adorable gnomes\, snowy 
 scenes\, and festive decorations. We’ll add to the magic by sharing a 
 delightful winter story to spark young imaginations. Come enjoy a wonderful 
 blend of storytelling\, creativity\, and hands-on fun as we bring a little 
 winter magic to life!\n\nLimited spots! The registration fee of $35 must be 
 paid in cash\, check made out to the "Friends of the West Caldwell Public 
 Library"\, or a Venmo payment @Friends_of_WCPL (Please include your first 
 and last name in the note). Please call the Reference Desk (973.226.5441) 
 to secure your spot!\n\nFor children ages 5  with a caregiver.\n\n
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
