SUMMARY:Mah Jongg Open Play
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Mah Jongg Open Play\, yummy snacks\, and great company. Tables will be thoughtfully arranged by skill level so everyone can jump right in and enjoy the game.  Have your own set? Please bring it along! \nLocation: JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\nFee: $18/person \nREGISTER HERE\n  \n  \n 
