SUMMARY:ADULT CRAFTERNOON: Felted Polar Bear
DESCRIPTION:Join fiber artist and instructor Christine Hsiao for a fun and 
 relaxing needle felting workshop as you create an adorable polar bear and 
 its favorite fish from soft sheep wool. Learn the basics of needle 
 felting\, including shaping\, sculpting\, and adding details\, while 
 transforming fluffy wool into a cute polar bear. This is a 
 beginner-friendly class and all materials will be provided. No prior 
 experience is needed. Come enjoy a creative experience\, learn a new 
 craft\, and take home a unique handcrafted polar bear complete with its 
 needle-felted fish companion!\n\nAdult Program | Registration 
 Required*\nOPEN to all
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
