SUMMARY:Chess Class - Grades 1-9
DESCRIPTION:Learn to play and strategize chess. All levels of experience 
 welcome. Grades 1-9. \n\nPLEASE REGISTER YOUR CHILD'S NAME NOT THE 
 PARENT/CAREGIVER.\n\nThis one hour class meets December 1\, 8\, 15\, 
 22\n\nPlease plan on attending all classes. Glen Ridge residents 
 only.\n\nChildren under the age of 8 must be accompanied by an adult at all 
 times.
