CREATED:20261026T210756Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T140935Z
UID:10004910-1798138800-1798146000@jccmetrowest.org
SUMMARY:J-Films: Hava Nagila
DESCRIPTION:J-Films and The Center for Adult Enrichment Present Hava Nagila\nJoin us for good times and great company at JCC MetroWest! \nBob Dylan sang it. So did Elvis. It’s one of the most familiar melodies ever written\, a Jewish anthem that has transcended its origins. It’s “Hava Nagila!” This rollicking film follows the song’s journey from shtetls to the Catskills to an international phenomenon\, exploring Jewish history\nand cross-cultural connections along the way. \nDoors open & refreshments will be served at 6:30 (please enter only by the theater)\n73 minutes • English with English subtitles\nFREE for the Community — Advance Registration Recommended. \nREGISTER HERE\n  \nSponsored by: \n \n\n  \nWATCH TRAILER
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/hava-nagilia/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Enrichment,JFilms
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/JFilms27_Hava-Nagila_Hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Stuart Weinstock":MAILTO:sweinstock@jccmetrowest.org
GEO:40.7674616;-74.2963088
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater 760 Northfield Ave West Orange NJ 07052 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=760 Northfield Ave:geo:-74.2963088,40.7674616
END:VEVENT
