SUMMARY:YOUTUBE/FACEBOOK - MICHAEL SHAWN AND THE TAKEOVER LEGENDS PODCAST:
  WEDNESDAY WORD
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261230T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261230T090000
UID:c58f08c184a436457034bec3fa09a8db@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday at 8 AM on Michael Shawn &amp\; The Take Over 
 Legends\, Lady Renaissance (aka KT) brings the poets to you! The Wednesday
  Word is a live weekly segment featuring some of the dopest poets in the s
 poken-word community — for raw interviews\, panel discussions\, and conv
 ersations that go beyond the page. Curated by Kierstin Tonic (Lady Renaiss
 ance)\, co-founder of Lyrics To Go and curator of community arts spaces\, 
 The Wednesday Word is where the open mic meets the podcast. Live. Unfilter
 ed. On purpose. Catch it live every Wednesday at 8 AM on YouTube and Faceb
 ook — or catch the replay and share the word! THEME: POET FEATURE HOST: 
 Lady Renaissance (aka KT) FEATURES: The Wednesday Word is a live weekly se
 gment featuring some of the dopest poets in the spoken-word community PRIC
 E: FREE - https://www.youtube.com/@michaelshawnandtakeoverlegends CONTACT:
  @ladyrenaissance21
LOCATION:NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/wednesday-word-12-30
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
