 n opportunity to share experiences\, ask questions\, and discuss common ca
 regiving challenges\, including how to keep loved ones safe\, when to seek
  additional help\, living arrangements\, and managing confusion or changes
  in behavior.The Caregiving Group meets on the first Thursday of each mont
 h at 
