DTSTART:20270107T210000Z
DTEND:20270107T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20270107T000000Z
SUMMARY:Middle School Mayhem and Laugh-Out-Loud Misadventures with Jeff Kinney
DESCRIPTION:Join us online for a hilarious\, action-packed virtual 
 conversation with #1 international bestselling author Jeff Kinney as he 
 introduces the 21st book in his globally beloved series\, Diary of a Wimpy 
 Kid: Fight or Flight. \n\nGreg Heffley is about to learn that surviving 
 middle school is no easy feat.\n\nIn Fight or Flight\, Greg’s hard-earned 
 expertise on navigating the rough-and-tumble world of middle school is put 
 to the test.\n\nWhen a secret binder filled with Greg’s notes on the 
 school’s biggest bullies falls into the wrong hands\, his world quickly 
 begins to unravel. Now it’s a race against time before the truth comes 
 out. Will Greg throw in the towel―or go down swinging?\n\nComplete with 
 Kinney's signature comic illustrations and sharp\, laugh-out-loud humor\, 
 this latest installment captures the awkward\, unpredictable realities of 
 growing up that have made Greg Heffley an icon for generations of 
 readers.\n\nRegister today to gain exclusive\, behind-the-scenes access to 
 Jeff Kinney’s creative universe! \n\n \n\nAbout the Author: \n\nJeff 
 Kinney is a #1 New York Times bestselling author\, a six-time Nickelodeon 
 Kids' Choice Award winner for Favorite Book\, and one of Time magazine's 
 100 Most Influential People in the World. He spent his childhood in the 
 Washington\, D.C.\, area and later moved to Massachusetts\, where he and 
 his family own a bookstore called An Unlikely Story.
