UID:tribe-18706@montclairfoundation.org
DESCRIPTION:January 10\, 2027 –Jessica Valiente–Los Más Valientes\,sa
 lsa and Latin jazz ensemble featuring flute\, bass and percussion. In addi
 tion to classic Afro-Cuban jazz standards\, they compose daring originals 
 that have pushed beyond the borders of typical Latin jazz. Their music is 
 rootsy\, pulsating rhythms from every corner of Latin America and the Cari
 bbean\, winning glowing reviews in six languages from critics all over the
  world.https://jessicavaliente.com/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House &#038\; Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/second-sunday-concert-series-jes
 sica-valiente-ensemble/
X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
END:VEVENT
