X-SOURCE-ID:ics_kstx8swyw669kakgqa_6478083_ics
SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Pa
 rt III
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T180000
DTSTAMP:20261111T180315Z
UID:TU2144131245
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804T175205Z
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narrative
 s about the First Intifada**  \nA Conversation led by Rabbi Justus Baird 
  \n  \nIn this three-part learning series\, we will explore multiple narra
 tives of the last century of events in Israel/Palestine\, specifically fro
 m Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal will not be to d
 ebate those narratives nor change our own\, but simply to hear and engage 
 with them.  \n  \nThe first session in May focused on the establishment of
  the State of Israel.    \nThe second session in November focused on the 
 Balfour Declaration period.  \nThis third session will focus on the First 
 Intifada.  \n  \nPlease register so that Rabbi Justus can share materials 
 with you before the class.   \n(link to come)  \n  \nParticipants should 
 expect the learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psyc
 hologically.  \n  \nReading in advance of each session will be strongly en
 couraged.  \n  \nJoining both sessions is recommended but not required.  \
 n  \nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Qu
 estions?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 74
 6-5031\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T232327Z
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\,
  USA\, Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131245
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
X-TEAMUP-ROOM:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07
 042\, USA\, Social Hall
END:VEVENT
