SUMMARY:Greening Your Finances w/ GreenPortfolio - Hybrid Event
DESCRIPTION:Where you bank\, how you invest\, and the financial providers 
 you choose all play a part in your climate impact.\n\n​We’ll discuss 
 approaches to climate-aligned personal finance and easy steps you can take 
 to start digging into the impact of your money.\n\n​We’ll dive into 
 topics including:\n\n\n	\n	​Climate-conscious banking 
 options\n	\n	\n	​How to spot fossil fuel exposure in 
 investments\n	\n	\n	​Key questions to ask potential financial 
 advisors\n	\n	\n	​Ways to maximize your money’s climate 
 impact\n	\n\n\n​This virtual session is for everyone\, whether you are 
 just starting out or have tried to green your finances before!\n\nHosted by 
 GreenPortfolio\, the nationwide advisor matching service that connects 
 individuals with financial advisors specializing in wealth management with 
 climate as a priority. Its free platform is designed for investors who 
 demand both impact and growth from their money\, working to decarbonize 
 retail wealth at scale.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Technology
UID:LibCal-10286-17911763
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17911763
END:VEVENT
